From 665712595f477268b821f6bd92ddfc9430af5f9b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: FP mod <fpmod@localhost>
Date: Mon, 26 Oct 2026 21:06:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 10/26] Mystery encounters: wandering Digimon shown as a ?
 until the battle

F1 > Display > Mystery encounters: 1 per floor, 30% of encounters, all
except bosses, or off (the default). Each enemy party gets its boss flag and
a roll from the mod's own generator when the floor is built; the notes live
in host memory so they survive the overlay reload after a battle. The model
is replaced by a floating ? (its anim still runs), in every camera view, and
mystery parties are left off the enemy info list. Setting mystery_encounters.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01B1oHeiADE8njqFxkaQnJAX
